p('Curtailment is highly panel dependent. Panel 1 is almost nonbinding, Panel 2 curtails approximately 10.68–10.89 kWh/feeder-day, and Panel 3 approximately 0.090–0.115. Power-factor brackets are engineering assumptions supported by relevant operator guidance; they are not derived from these historical household meters. The main 800 kVA transformer is unchanged. In the rural 160 kVA topology, 55 historical households are aggregated to 13 native load locations, causing some nominal-rating exceedance even without voltage events; this is a constructed load-transfer stress case, not a measurement of that real circuit.')
